OL,3,GNEWSAFirst bus franchising contracts
OL,4,Afor region signed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first buses to run under West
OL,7,FYorkshire's publicly controlled
OL,8,Ffranchise network will begin service
OL,9,Fnext spring, it has been confirmed.
OL,11,FFirst Bus and Transdev have been handed
OL,12,Fcontracts to operate buses in the
OL,13,Fregion by the West Yorkshire Combined
OL,14,FAuthority (WYCA), which will have power
OL,15,Fto set routes and fares under the new
OL,16,Fsystem.
OL,18,FUnder the deals, First West Yorkshire
OL,19,Fwill run services in Huddersfield and
OL,20,Fparts of Leeds, while Transdev
OL,21,FBlazefield will operate buses in
OL,22,FDewsbury.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
