OL,3,GNEWSAFirst bus franchising contracts
OL,4,Afor region signed
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast month, plans to give First a
OL,7,Fcontract for services were heavily
OL,8,Fcriticised by the passenger group
OL,9,FBetter Buses West Yorkshire, who cited
OL,10,Fthe firm's lowly rank in a national
OL,11,Ftransport survey.
